          <h2>
            AI-powered Team Matching Platform
          </h2>

          <p class="project-overview-description">
            Team Up is an AI-powered web application designed to help event organizers efficiently build balanced project teams.

Instead of manually reviewing dozens of registration forms, organizers describe their event goals, and the platform automatically generates customized registration questions, collects participant responses, and intelligently recommends team assignments.

The initial MVP was developed during the Google Developer Mac-a-Thon and later evolved into a React-based application.
